Expected elements: present

Presence holds: the `Data` provenance row is the only marker form on the page, Age reads "No timestamp published", all eight sections carry data or a statement, the footer's heart, CodeTracer and GitHub marks are all drawn in visible indigo, Generate trace is the strongest control, and there is no Debug button, empty panel or disabled control. Finality sits in the grid rather than the hero — present and labelled, so not a presence failure.

Round changes. (a) Landed: RAW renders `—`; SELECTOR holds `0x1a2b3c4d`, so the rule is not exercised there. It inherited the value colour — finding 5. (b) Partial: the only cost row reads `COST · MANA`; the dot form landed but the second segment is still the raw resource key and duplicates the unit in the value. (c) Landed.

All three re-measures hold. Age/Canonical/Finality still share one token (#F3F3F3 / #C8C8C8 / #565656) across absent-datum, affirmative fact and in-progress state while green #DCFCE7/#166534 proves affirmative exists. Indigo #4F46E5 (243°) and blue #2563EB (221°) are now 16px apart, not 14, and the chip is the page's only outline pill, so it reads as a secondary button. Raw is still the only container at canvas level (#ECECEB), held by a #A2A2A2 hairline at 2.16:1.

Contrast is good: every text-on-surface pair clears AA, lowest 5.32:1 (breadcrumb link #4F46E5 on canvas), then 5.40:1 (resolver placeholder). Light-first, not inverted.

Fixes: raise the border token above 3:1; split the grey chip into three tones.

Rating: 6/10

